{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43553","headline":"道州春日感兴 · 李景俭","name":"道州春日感兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"始见花满枝，又看花满地。\n且持增气酒，莫滴伤心泪。\n深诚长郁结，芳晨自妍媚。\n啸歌聊永日，谁知此时意。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李景俭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}